  "description": "After a major scuffle on the bridge, Jedi heroes Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker wrest control of General Grievous' flagship from enemy hands, although the wily cyborg manages a super-fast escape. The ship is safely landed on Coruscant after some anxious moments, and Anakin is reunited with the great love of his life, Padmé Amidala. These two have secretly married, a fateful union destined to produce remarkable children. Even as they contemplate a happy future together, events about them start spinning out of control. Yoda and Mace Windu, among others, have begun to suspect that Chancellor Palpatine is more than simply the benign galactic leader he pretends to be..."
